BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Meet the Author with Griselda Maldonado
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T110000
DTSTAMP:20260804T104158Z
UID:8ab2ab45c9d43a621912dc8617da829e@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:children,play,toddler,museum,family
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nStorytime and Meet the Author with Gri
 selda Maldonado!\nTIMES: 11 am ONLY\nAbout the play partner: \nDr. Grisel
 da Maldonado is a Santa Ana native\, educator\, and bilingual author who c
 elebrates culture through storytelling. Inspired by her family’s journey
 \, she is dedicated to preserving language and tradition for future genera
 tions. \nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/drgriseldaauthor/?hl=en \
 nLinkedln: https://www.linkedin.com/in/griselda-maldonado-ed-d-ab1879306/
  \nX: https://x.com/drgrismaldonado \n \nBook Bio: This heartwarming 
 bilingual children’s book follows Abuelita as she lovingly prepares a va
 riety of traditional Mexican dishes in her kitchen. As she cooks\, young r
 eaders are introduced to numbers one through ten\, vibrant vegetables\, ri
 ch colors\, and cultural foods found in the mercado and at family gather
 ings. Through rhythmic\, repetitive text in English and Spanish\, the stor
 y celebrates language\, family traditions\, and the joy of cooking togethe
 r. It invites children to count\, learn new vocabulary\, and connect with 
 their heritage while honoring the warmth and love of an abuelita’s kit
 chen.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendcity.org/events/meet-the-author-w
 ith-griselda-maldonado/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/meet-the-author-with-griselda-maldo
 nado/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow: Meet the Author with Griselda Maldonado
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:In 2 hours: Meet the Author with Griselda Maldonado
TRIGGER:-PT2H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
