SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:storytime,library,baby,toddler,family,Arts & Crafts
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Irvine Public Library - Heritage Park\\nCost: free\
 \nAges: 0-60 months\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nExplore Shibori tie-dye\, a
  traditional Japanese resist-dyeing technique that creates stunning intric
 ate one-of-a-kind patterns. Discover simple folding and binding methods\, 
 then create your own piece to take home. Bring that favorite tee or tote y
