BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Food as Medicine with Rady Children’s Health
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260828T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260828T120000
DTSTAMP:20260804T104158Z
UID:eae5eeac04e601b2c9f771759d05c1da@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:children,play,toddler,museum,family
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Play & Games\\n\\nJoin us for Food as Medicine\, a h
 ands-on experience where kids and their grown-ups explore seasonal\, nouri
 shing foods together with Rady Children’s Health.   \nTimes: 11am-12
 pm  \n*Please note programming lasts 10-30 minutes. \nAbout the Play Pa
 rtner:\nRady Children’s Health (RCH)\, a premier pediatric healthcare sy
 stem in Southern California\, unites the trusted expertise of Children’s
  Hospital of Orange County (CHOC)\, nationally recognized for its commitme
 nt to safe\, high-quality care\, and Rady Children’s Hospital San Diego\
 , ranked among the nation’s top 10 children’s hospitals by U.S. News &
 amp\; World Report. @chocchildrens \nIncluded in museum admission. Space
  is limited! Book your tickets now. \n*Members do not require a reserva
 tion.\n*Events and dates are subject to change. \nFrequently Asked Questi
 ons \nIs this program included with museum admission?\nYes. Food as Med
 icine is included with regular museum admission. \nWill there be food sam
 ples?\nYes. Families will have the opportunity to sample seasonal foods du
 ring the program. \nWhat kinds of activities will children explore?\nChil
 dren may participate in sensory stations\, food demonstrations\, and han
 ds-on activities focused on healthy eating and nutrition. \nWill recipes 
 be available?\nYes. Families may receive recipes and ideas for easy\, nutr
 itious meals and snacks they can make at home.\\n\\nMore info: https://www
 .pretendcity.org/events/food-as-medicine-with-rady-childrens-health-3/
